[{"id":126188,"sender_id":11,"sender_full_name":"Urs","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b00d1ee17463af676c78974439b92471?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/2-Latest-Changes/topic/nLab.20materials/near/126188\">#1</a> starting something, experimental for the time being:</p>\n<p>A list of materials for <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span>Lab entries that go beyond what reasonably fits into an <a href=\"https://golem.ph.utexas.edu/wiki/instiki/show/HomePage\">Instiki</a> webpage.</p>\n<p>Currently just 2 items in the list.</p>\n<p>Full <code>LaTeX</code> sources are provided in the <code>.zip</code> files. If you want to work on material, please edit the sources and upload the update here.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/revision/nLab+materials/1\">v1</a>, <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/nLab+materials\">current</a></p>","timestamp":1791356323,"subject":"nLab materials","stream_id":2,"display_recipient":"Latest Changes","reactions":[]},{"id":126198,"sender_id":11,"sender_full_name":"Urs","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b00d1ee17463af676c78974439b92471?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/2-Latest-Changes/topic/nLab.20materials/near/126198\">#2</a> added to the Morse-Bott theory materials (<a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/nLab+materials#MorseBottOfLoopSpaces\">here</a>) a zip-file with <code>Lean</code> auto-formalization of what is currently Thm. 4.22 there, computing <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_1 L L_1 S^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9641em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (the fundamental groups of the free loop space of the first Morse-Bott stage of the free loop space space of the 2-sphere)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/revision/diff/nLab+materials/3\">diff</a>, <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/revision/nLab+materials/3\">v3</a>, <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/nLab+materials\">current</a></p>","timestamp":1791473788,"subject":"nLab materials","stream_id":2,"display_recipient":"Latest Changes","reactions":[]},{"id":126348,"sender_id":612,"sender_full_name":"nLab edit announcer","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/c58b62e30f75d369349d5c08eee8f6b9?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/2-Latest-Changes/topic/nLab.20materials/near/126348\">#3</a> Added supplementary materials for monodromy in homotopy type theory, including a Cubical Agda formalization, mathematical exposition, and source-to-code alignment records.</p>\n<p>Hongwei Wang</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/revision/diff/nLab+materials/12\">diff</a>, <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/revision/nLab+materials/12\">v12</a>, <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/nLab+materials\">current</a></p>","timestamp":1794247171,"subject":"nLab materials","stream_id":2,"display_recipient":"Latest Changes","reactions":[]}]